      "speaker": "Astra",
      "text": "The environment has moved to Sudoku; work from this grid now. In your last revision, the quoted statements changed while you analyzed them, making the checks unreliable. Here, preserve every given digit and test your completed grid against rows, columns, and 2\u00d72 blocks. If a placement creates a conflict, revisit that placement rather than changing a given. Submit in the requested grid format when ready; completion alone is not verification."
